{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB《璀璨之城》陳瀅「剥光豬」色誘張智霖一幕，因尺度極之大膽，引起網上極大熱議，有些更揚言要作出投訴，而通訊事務管理局辦公室（通訊局）今（16日）回覆截至昨日為止，共接獲28宗投訴，當中25宗涉及昨晚(15日)播出的集數，現正按既定程序處理。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T14:20:30.360429+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T13:20:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T14:17:43.127115+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T14:17:43.127115+00:00","content_hash":"abd4a9666a0e7e2a24f1d2f3be76996efb57182fae4d11aa1b8941c2f3dd280a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}